// server.cid — 100% Pure Freestanding Cider implementation of the Million Users Challenge
// One epoll loop per CPU core, direct dual SO_REUSEPORT listeners on PORT and EXTRA_PORT,
// non-blocking libpq pipeline mode with dedicated write connections and iteration Sync batching,
// zero heap allocations on hot path, libdeflate gzip compression for feed.

